# Exclude repo internals from Workers static asset uploads
# This file uses .gitignore syntax. Place it in the ROOT of your assets directory.

# --- Git / GitHub ---
**/.git
**/.github
**/.gitignore

# --- Dependencies ---
**/node_modules
**/package.json
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# --- Build tooling / config ---
**/wrangler.jsonc
**/wrangler.toml
**/tsconfig.json
**/vite.config.*
**/.dev.vars*
**/.wrangler

# --- Repo metadata ---
**/README.md
**/README.*
**/LICENSE
**/LICENSE.*
**/CNAME
**/.DS_Store

# --- Source files (uncomment if you have a build step and only want dist/ uploaded) ---
# **/src/
# **/*.ts
# **/*.tsx
# **/*.jsx
